<title>GEORGIA: Georgian August inflation quickens to 0.2 pct.</title>
<headline>Georgian August inflation quickens to 0.2 pct.</headline>
<dateline>TBILISI 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Georgia's monthly consumer price inflation was 0.2 percent in August after a 1.4 percent price fall in July, the Department for Social and Economic Information said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>    GEORGIAN CONSUMER PRICES   AUG 96   JULY 96    AUG 95</p>
<p>    Month-on-month change	  +0.2	-1.4	+3.3</p>
<p>    Year-on-year change	  +147.1    +151.6    +314.6</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
